The eBPF programs `#include "vmlinux.h"`, a dump of the running kernel's
BTF type information generated by `bpftool btf dump`. vmlinux.h carries
the Linux kernel's GPL-2.0 license, and the eBPF bytecode loaded into
the kernel declares `SEC("license") = "GPL"` so the verifier permits
GPL-only helpers. The .c sources in this repo are MPL-2.0; the GPL
declaration applies only to the loaded bytecode at runtime as required
by the kernel ABI.

